        "2. Hazards identification"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "2. Hazards identification"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "2. Hazards identification"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "Health: The product is not classified as hazardous. Inhalation of dust may irritate the respiratory tract.\nProlonged inhalation of high doses of decomposition products may give headache or irritation of the respiratory\ntract.\nFire: The product burns, but is not classified as flammable.\nEnvironment: The product is not considered hazardous for the environment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "3. Composition/information on ingredients"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "3. Composition/information on ingredients"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "3. Composition/information on ingredients"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "The product is a polyethylene polymer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "3. Composition/information on ingredients"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "Contains no substance classified as hazardous in concentrations, which should be taken into account according\nto EU regulations."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "4. First aid measures"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "4. First aid measures"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "4. First aid measures"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "No specific instructions needed.\nSkin contact: Cool melted product on skin with plenty of water. Do not remove solidified product."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "5. Firefighting measures"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "5. Firefighting measures"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "5. Firefighting measures"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "Suitable extinguishing media: Water in spread jet, dry chemicals, foam or carbon dioxide.\nSpecial exposure hazards: Principal toxicant in the smoke is carbon monoxide."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "6. Accidental release measures"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "6. Accidental release measures"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "6. Accidental release measures"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "Vacuum or sweep up spill. All spill of material must be removed immediately to prevent slipping accidents."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "7. Handling and storage"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "7. Handling and storage"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "7. Handling and storage"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "Handling: During processing and thermal treatment of the product, small amounts of volatile hydrocarbons may\nbe released. Provide adequate ventilation. Local exhaust ventilation may be necessary. Avoid inhalation of dust\nand decomposition fumes. Dust from the product gives a potential risk for dust explosion. All equipment shall be\ngrounded.\nStorage: Safety aspects do not require any special precautions in terms of storage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 1,
      "section_path": [
        "7. Handling and storage"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "BorSafe is a trademark of the Borealis group."
    },
