    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "8. Exposure controls/personal protection"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "Provide adequate ventilation. Local exhaust ventilation may be necessary."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "9. Physical and chemical properties"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "9. Physical and chemical properties"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "9. Physical and chemical properties"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "Appearance: solid, blue\nOdour: odourless"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "9. Physical and chemical properties"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "Melting point/range: 100 – 140 °C Ignition temperature: > 320 °C\nDensity: 0,9 - 1,0 g/cm³ Water solubility: insoluble in water"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "10. Stability and reactivity"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "10. Stability and reactivity"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "10. Stability and reactivity"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "The product is a stable thermoplastic, with no chemical reactivity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "11. Toxicological information"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "11. Toxicological information"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "11. Toxicological information"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "The product is not classified as hazardous according to Regulation (EC) No 1272/2008. Inhalation of dust may\nirritate the respiratory tract. Prolonged inhalation of high doses of decomposition products may give headache\nor irritation of the respiratory tract."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "12. Ecological information"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "12. Ecological information"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "12. Ecological information"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "The product is not considered hazardous for the environment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "13. Disposal considerations"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "13. Disposal considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "13. Disposal considerations"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "Reuse or recycle if not contaminated. The product may be safely used as fuel. Proper combustion does not\nrequire any special flue gas control. Check with local regulations."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "14. Transport information"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "14. Transport information"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "14. Transport information"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "The product is not regulated by ADR/RID, IMDG or IATA."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "15. Regulatory information"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "15. Regulatory information"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "page": 2,
      "section_path": [
        "15. Regulatory information"
      ],
      "zone": "main",
      "text": "In accordance with Regulation (EC) No 1272/2008, the product does not need to be classified nor labelled."
    },
